{"data":[{"author_id":"791197","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:03:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112560349249487343"],"id":"2112560349249487343","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":118666,"like_count":86,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":4},"text":"在来自一位海外中国异议人士的传言传开后，朝鲜官媒发布了金正恩与女儿金主爱视察展览的照片。对于密切关注朝鲜的人来说，这类传言几乎已成为例行公事。 https://t.co/SNwBAdvQKS","url":"https://x.com/bbcchinese/status/2112560349249487343"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:03:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112560244182204424"],"id":"2112560244182204424","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26488,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我国星期三（10月21日）24小时空气污染指数，预计介于110点至180点之间，属不健康水平。 https://t.co/jY94nyYxZG","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2112560244182204424"},{"author_id":"46574977","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:01:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112559806431047734"],"id":"2112559806431047734","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":14869,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我们大多数人都不喜欢在办公室里开口求人。一方面是不想给别人添麻烦，一方面也担心被拒绝，总之就是觉得很尴尬。数十年来的研究发现，只要我们懂得如何开口，别人答应我们请求的意愿比我们想象中要强得多。而懂得如何开口，并没有想象中那么复杂。https://t.co/xeFkXAzJkX","url":"https://x.com/ChineseWSJ/status/2112559806431047734"},{"author_id":"121908437","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:00:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112559668879094159"],"id":"2112559668879094159","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":56,"impression_count":48627,"like_count":120,"quote_count":14,"reply_count":53,"retweet_count":7},"text":"这是整整十六年前（2010 年 10 月 20 日），乔布斯在\"Back to the Mac\"的发布会上，花了一分多钟介绍为什么 Apple 不做触摸板的 Mac。\n\n时间来到现在，Apple 将在一周后（10 月 28 日）的洛杉矶举办\"Pro and tell\"发布会，传闻将发布首台支持触摸屏的 Mac。 https://t.co/3WbxwxjugS","url":"https://x.com/tualatrix/status/2112559668879094159"},{"author_id":"143810986","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":[